<article class="prose">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <p>The Excellent Internet is a public shelf of keeps. A site is listed only when it has been actively agreed as a keep. This is not a blog, and it is not an archive of every daily candidate. Skips and sites still waiting for a decision never appear.</p>
  <p>The shelf is updated weekly, and only when something is worth adding — usually near the end of a subscription week. It is not a day-to-day feed. When nothing new is kept, the cabinet stays as it is.</p>
  <p>Browse by what a site is for. The cards are the whole collection.</p>
